1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,960
Have you got 181 unread emails?

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,990
Tried filters, or reminders?

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,310
But have you tried a sword?

4
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:09,770
Or a flamethrower?

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,860
Slash, burn, and smash your way to Inbox Zero!

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,690
Built for the Meta Start Hackathon

7
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,650
it's a game to clear your inbox

8
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,040
one round at a time

9
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:20,910
Here's how it works

10
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:23,100
Connect our MCP to your Muse agent

11
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,710
and ask it to set up a game!

12
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:28,130
It reads your newest unread emails

13
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:30,580
and makes you a special link that opens right on your Meta Quest!

14
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:32,300
Pick your level

15
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,300
and hit play!

16
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:36,070
Grab an email with your left hand to read it

17
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:37,280
throw it to keep it

18
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,800
or take your right hand and cut it up into tiny little pieces

19
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,870
Every email you keep comes back with two short replies from your agent

20
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,390
Hold it up to the one you like

21
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:48,030
pull it close to say your own

22
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:50,370
or throw it away and leave it for tomorrow

23
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:54,010
Just a few minutes a day to clear your email anxiety

24
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:57,310
and you finally get to smash your monitor with your keyboard!

25
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:03,240
Defend your castle from haunted mail!

26
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:09,140
Disinfect toxic spam in the lab!

27
00:01:12,630 --> 00:01:15,360
Torch your inbox in the Inferno mail room!

28
00:01:18,850 --> 00:01:21,850
Slice your worries away in a Kyoto zen garden!

29
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:27,430
Split your backlog with an axe!

30
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,330
Or…

31
00:01:31,350 --> 00:01:34,310
slice through deep space with a laser sword!

32
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:40,330
It's built with Meta's Immersive Web SDK

33
00:01:40,350 --> 00:01:41,910
so it runs right in the browser

34
00:01:41,930 --> 00:01:43,420
with nothing to download!

35
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,200
It's made to play from your chair

36
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:48,180
Emails come to you, and your weapons do the stretching!

37
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:54,110
And it really does clear your inbox

38
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:56,040
Your agent archives what you cut

39
00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:57,200
and sends your replies

40
00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:58,500
after you say okay

41
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:01,440
The game never touches your inbox

42
00:02:01,460 --> 00:02:03,630
and each round is deleted once it's done

43
00:02:04,410 --> 00:02:07,760
Try it yourself at InboxZeroVR.com!

44
00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:09,720
Play the demo in all seven levels

45
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:12,340
or connect your agent and play your own inbox

46
00:02:12,370 --> 00:02:15,610
Become a hero with inbox zero!
